---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Legal · HyphaeHub">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-substrate">Legal & responsible use</h1>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-ink/70">
      <p>
        HyphaeHub is a record-keeping tool. It is species-agnostic and does not endorse,
        encourage, or facilitate the cultivation of any particular organism. You are solely
        responsible for ensuring that whatever you cultivate, and how you cultivate it, complies
        with all laws and regulations that apply in your jurisdiction.
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-mycelium bg-parchment p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-substrate">Your data</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
          The Community Edition stores all data on infrastructure you control. In the hosted Cloud
          edition, your data is stored on Cloudflare and is never sold. You can export or delete
          your data at any time.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-mycelium bg-parchment p-5">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-substrate">No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
          The software is provided “as is”, without warranty of any kind, under the MIT license.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink/50">
        This page is a short summary. For the full details, see our
        <a class="font-medium text-hyphae-700 hover:underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        and
        <a class="font-medium text-hyphae-700 hover:underline" href="/terms">Terms &amp; Usage Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
